"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-29T03:56:12-07:00","id":606465,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/605750-kindred-alchemy-as-a-blood-sorcery?p=606113#post606113\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think Prince is talking about Blood Alchemy from the Ordo book.</div> </div> </div> </div> Well, he could also mean Blut Alchemie, which was a pretty bad ass discipline for an Ordo Dracul based bloodline. If all he wanted was a direct port of Blood Alchemy from the Ordo book, the best way would be to simply go something like:<br /> <br /> Blood Alchemy [blood sorcery]<br /> Cost: 1 vitae<br /> Requirement: Ordo Dracul 1<br /> Intelligence + Science + Blood Alchemy<br /> Same time as other sorceries<br /> Condition from dramatic failure: <br /> Condition from exceptional success: Inspired<br /> ((Add +1 to +3 to reflect rare components, such as wolf blood or heart of diablarist))<br /> <br /> <br /> Spoiling becomes its own ritual. Store up successes beforehand, then unleash Potency in penalties, as per discipline. TN: 5 + penalties<br /> All other blood alchemy devotions port directly to rituals at ((1-disciple dots, min 1))<br /> <br /> That's the best I can think off the top of my head","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-29T09:18:42-07:00","id":606672,"title":"","content":"Yes I meant Blut Alchemie, which is an awesome discipline. great way to get rich if your clever.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-29T14:37:56-07:00","id":607143,"title":"","content":"There was a thread about the Geheim Bloodline and Blut Alchemie. This is the Link:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/106730-geheim-in-blood-and-smoke\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/106730-geheim-in-blood-and-smoke\"> Geheim in Blood and Smoke - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/106730-geheim-in-blood-and-smoke\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/106730-geheim-in-blood-and-smoke </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> I'm thinking of doing a blood and smoke rewrite of the Geheim bloodline, making their Blut Alchemie powers something more in line with the standard power level of B&amp;amp;S, and I figured I'd ask for opinions before I get started. The bloodline bane would be fairly easy, a penalty to resist vitae addiction </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I hope you find there what you are looking for.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2195-sethos","name":"Sethos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"289"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}